  <item>
    <title>Ep.13唱唱反调：性萧条❌“性”的变革✅</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67186edadb2cf8275746a639</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67186edadb2cf8275746a639</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 23 Oct 2024 03:34:50 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="112">01:52</a>热词索引：“性萧条”到底是什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="498">08:18</a>性方式的多元化的变更与对人们性生活的具体影响</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="844">14:04</a>唱唱反调，“性”还没有萧条</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="940">15:40</a>“睡个素觉”盛行与男同之间的抱抱睡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1172">19:32</a> 单次收费版“sugar daddy”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1330">22:10</a>手天使，残疾人中的欲望关怀</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1925">32:05</a>黄昏下的生命力蓬勃的东单公园</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2097">34:57</a>流浪汉的欲望，桥洞下的洗浴中心</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2408">40:08</a> 酒吧与铁道下那些隐秘的工作者们</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2721">45:21</a>多样的方式带给我们性体验的影响</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2778">46:18</a>从2000到2024那些不同的时代不同的性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3094">51:34</a>性神秘性和神圣感的被消解</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3354">55:54</a>超级城市的性饥荒，为什么我们的性欲望减少了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3471">57:51</a>“便利店式的性”现代中性的自给自足</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3691">01:01:31</a>越高知的女性婚姻率越低</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3867">01:04:27</a>性不再是那个伴随成功而来的奖励</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4041">01:07:21</a>性的碎片化与成瘾性？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4797">01:19:57</a>新的时代官能症：强烈的边界感与孤独的内心</span></p><span></span><p><span>【嘉宾】</span></p><span></span><p><span>周老师</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Lily</span></p><span></span><p><span>牙牙</span></p><span></span><p><span>【BGM】</span></p><span></span><p><span>I've Told Every Little Star</span></p><span></span><p><span>My Shawl&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>California Dreamin'</span></p>]]></description>
