    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>没错，Lily老师是一个每天都会随身携HIV检测试纸的男人。</span></p><span></span><p><span>作为一个常在河边走的gay，有一天他终于露馅了。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这一天，他在妈妈的爱中他终于在家中出柜了。</span></p><span></span><p><span>老潘和牙牙在好奇调侃之余，也更深入了解了HIV。它是什么，它怎样传播，以及关于艾滋歧视的问题。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="43">00:43</a>我的妈妈在行李箱里翻出了hiv试纸</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="354">05:54</a>我那粗手粗脚又细腻十分的妈妈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="988">16:28</a>Lily老师为什么会随身携带试纸</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1329">22:09</a>一百个男人中唯一一个试纸阳性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1516">25:16</a> Lily被神助的惊险一刻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1909">31:49</a>检测试纸盒里有什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2248">37:28</a>关于hiv的歧视问题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2535">42:15</a>淡蓝公益</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Lily</span></p><span></span><p><span>老潘</span></p><span></span><p><span>牙牙</span></p><span></span><p><span>【BGM】</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>Variations in C major K.265</span></em></p>]]></description>
